        "death": "1871"
      },
      "history": ""
    },
    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.sCVTjJFrnyyVnQDt]{Profile: Marcus Whitmore}</p><blockquote><p><em>“A Prince doesn&#39;t rule. He chooses who rules in his name, and applauds.”</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Epithet</th><td>The Glass Prince</td></tr><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Prince of Seattle</td></tr><tr><th>Clan</th><td>Toreador</td></tr><tr><th>Sect</th><td>Camarilla</td></tr><tr><th>Sire</th><td>Clémence Aubert, a soprano with the San Francisco Opera</td></tr><tr><th>Born</th><td>1838</td></tr><tr><th>Embraced</th><td>1871</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>For his reign to be remembered as a golden age.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Looks about thirty-three. Tall, hair slicked back with no gray, very pale gray eyes; an impeccable suit with no tie and a ring with a black stone.</p>",
    "appearance": "<p>Looks about thirty-three. Tall, hair slicked back with no gray, very pale gray eyes; an impeccable suit with no tie and a ring with a black stone.</p>",
    "equipment": "",
    "notes": "",
    "privatenotes": "<p>Editor&#39;s Note: doc 06 said “looks about forty-five” and “silver hair”; the decision was to use his age at the Embrace (about 33, no gray). Doc 06 gave him six powers with Presence 5; Daunt was removed (one per dot).</p>",
